---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for play.first7.org"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="space-y-6 leading-8 opacity-90">
      <p>
        This website may use browser local storage to save preferences,
        gameplay progress, puzzle states, bookmarks, or other interactive
        features. This data stays on your device and is not transmitted to any
        server unless explicitly stated.
      </p>

      <p>
        This website may use analytics services to understand general site
        usage, such as page visits, device types, or gameplay interactions.
        These analytics do not intentionally collect personally identifiable
        information.
      </p>

      <p>
        Some pages may include share features or links to third-party services.
      </p>

      <p>
        Third-party services such as analytics providers or future
        advertisements may use cookies or similar technologies.
      </p>

      <p>
        This website is intended for educational, creative, and spiritual
        exploration purposes.
      </p>

      <p>
        This policy may be updated from time to time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>